{
  "name": "Analyze OfferUp Deal Monitor, Price Drop & Status Tracker deals with OpenAI and alert Slack, Telegram, and Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## OfferUp Deal Monitor, Price Drop & Status Tracker — AI Co-Pilot & Multi-App Pipeline\n\nExtracts fresh data on a schedule with the **[offerup-deal-monitor-scraper Apify Actor](https://apify.com/unitbytes/offerup-deal-monitor-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** ($0.0008 / item), skips seen records, logs all rows to **Google Sheets** and **CSV**, and enriches top matches with **OpenAI (`gpt-4o-mini`)** for **Slack** and **Telegram**.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Every 6 Hours** loads rules from **1. Configure Search & Rules**.\n2. **2. Run UnitBytes (offerup-deal-monitor-scraper)** fetches data and **3. Skip Seen Records** deduplicates by `listingId`.\n3. **4. Clean & Score Items** and **5. Map Export Fields** normalize `listingId, url, title, price` and compute `priorityScore`.\n4. **6a. Log to Google Sheets** and **6b. Export Backup CSV** save all rows, while **6c. Filter High-Priority Items** routes top matches to **7. AI Sourcing & Arbitrage Analyst**.\n5. **8. Merge AI Arbitrage Brief** merges AI fields and triggers **9a. Send Slack Deal & Arbitrage Alert** and **9b. Send Telegram Instant Deal Alert**.\n\n### Setup\n1. Add your token from [offerup-deal-monitor-scraper on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/offerup-deal-monitor-scraper?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) to the **HTTP Header Auth** credential on node 2.\n2. Edit `actorInput`, `sheetTab`, and `maxTargetPrice` in node 1.\n3. Connect **OpenAI**, **Google Sheets**, **Slack**, and **Telegram** credentials.\n\n### Customization\n- Adjust `maxTargetPrice` in node 1 or the prompt in node 7.\n- Docs: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/offerup-deal-monitor-scraper/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/offerup-deal-monitor-scraper/)",
        "height": 780,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      },
